{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>King Crab</i> is a physics-driven defense game where you shape the beach to survive. Dig trenches, pile up walls, and redirect waves as they crash toward your castle. Each round the ocean grows stronger, forcing you to adapt your defenses or watch everything wash away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the beach to uncover hidden items that give you new ways to defend. What you discover off the main path might be the key to surviving the next big wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on PC or step inside the action in VR. Either way, every scoop of sand and every wall you raise could be the difference between survival and defeat.  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2523690?t=1772351089","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772351089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523690/accc47943e4d2195f52c25bc57e9b67c8c8ee136/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772351089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2523690/accc47943e4d2195f52c25bc57e9b67c8c8ee136/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772351089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4349810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>King Crab</i> is a physics-driven defense game where you shape the beach to survive. Dig trenches, pile up walls, and redirect waves as they crash toward your castle. Each round the ocean grows stronger, forcing you to adapt your defenses or watch everything wash away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the beach to uncover hidde